              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Archers have hand weapon and composite bow. Light Infantry. They may have light armour (+2) and exchange composite bow for longbow (+1). If no Schiltron or artillery has been taken in the army, may be Riding horses (+1).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
